{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": []}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe7n2le01ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "enpe7n2le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"id": 0, "image": "enpe7n2le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "text": "<strong>David</strong>: Hello, Laura. Did you finish the homework about computer programs? </br>\n<strong>Laura</strong>: Yes, You find a lot of information on the internet; that's why I always do my homework in the computer lab. </br>\n<strong>David</strong>: Cool! I don't understand anything about programs. Can you explain to me what they are? </br>\n<strong>Laura</strong>: Sure, a computer program is a set of instructions and rules that computers need for functioning. Programmers design programs for particular tasks; they use programming languages to create and configure programs. </br>", "time": "100"}, {"id": 1, "image": "enpe7n2le01ob01re2img02.jpg", "text": "<strong>David</strong>: I understand now, do you know what the usefulness of programs is? </br>\n<strong>Laura</strong> Yes, without programs the computer cannot even run, so there are system programs that permit the machine to start; the machine executes those programs in the central processing unit. A computer program usually executes information with the help of an interpreter which is a platform that performs the instructions of each program. </br>\n<strong>David</strong>: Wow! And, how many programs are there? </br>\n<strong>Laura</strong>:  Well, there are as many computer programs as you can imagine. </br>", "time": "33000"}, {"id": 2, "image": "enpe7n2le01ob01re2img03.jpg", "text": "<strong>David</strong>: What are their features? </br>\n<strong>Laura</strong>: There are programs to perform any possible job. A programmer creates algorithms, which are the main structure of a program as they store its tasks and applications. Besides, there are different programing languages for creating the algorithms; all those languages still evolve!</br>\n<strong>David</strong>: What is the difference between system and operational software? </br>\n<strong>Laura</strong>: Well, system software refers to the operating system that permits the software and hardware interaction and functionality; on the other hand, operating software consists of the programs we work with, not only on the pc, but also online. </br>\n<strong>David</strong>: Thanks, Laura.", "time": "71000"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can explain what a computer program is.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about the usefulness of computer programs.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can describe key features related to computer programs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you use computer programs? Mention 5.", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How does a computer work?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "What is a Computer Program?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"id": 0, "responses": [{"selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"selected": 0, "id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "_data": [{"type": "question",